@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction
title Event Confirm — Proposed low-usage queue
caption Proposed architecture only. Rust API / worker and this queue are not implemented yet.

actor "Staff / external Agent" as Client
node "One Lightsail instance — Docker Compose" {
  component "nginx + Vite static frontend\nHTTPS / event-confirm prefix" as Web #EAF2FF
  component "Rust ntex API / Tokio\nSession / org + event credentials\nImports / run commands / callbacks" as API #EAF2FF
  database "PostgreSQL\ncall_jobs: NEW / FAIL lanes\nEvent ratio + durable counter\nAttempts + leases + available_at" as DB #E7F5ED
  component "Async Rust worker — 1 process\nX NEW calls then 1 FAIL call\n2:1 = N N F / 5:1 = N N N N N F\nEligible-lane fallback" as Worker #FFF8DF
  Web --> API
  API --> DB : transaction:\nrun + dispatch job
  DB --> Worker : atomic Event turn + lane claim\nSKIP LOCKED + lease
  Worker --> DB : record attempt / next due time\nshort transactions
}
cloud "Voice provider" as Provider #FFF1E5
cloud "Off-host encrypted backups\nRestore rehearsal required" as Backup

Client --> Web : HTTPS
Worker --> Provider : dispatch outside DB transaction\nstable request identity
Provider --> API : authenticated result callback
DB ..> Backup : scheduled backup

note bottom of Worker
  Terminal unknown + eligible reason: FAIL.
  confirm / decline: stop retries; ticket is independent.
  Answered is not the same as confirmed.
  Counter survives restart; count accepted dispatch once.
  Timeout / ambiguous dispatch: reconcile first.
  Do not sleep for 15 minutes or blindly redial.
  Dispatch concurrency != active-call capacity.
end note

legend bottom left
  MVP: PostgreSQL queue; no extra broker.
  AWS migration: keep this architecture.
  Optional future: outbox + SQS if needed.
  One instance is not high availability.
endlegend
@enduml
